msgstr "UPP/NER  Detaljer     EXIT  Tillbaka"

msgid "Receiver"
msgstr "Mottagare"

msgid "Image"
msgstr "Image"

msgid "Kernel"
msgstr "Kärna"

msgid ""
"The kernel decides which memory features are available. It is part of the "
"image and cannot be changed by a plugin."
msgstr ""
"Kärnan avgör vilka minnesfunktioner som finns. Den är en del av imagen och "
"kan inte ändras av ett tillägg."

msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

msgid "RAM"
msgstr "RAM"

#, python-format
msgid "%d times"
msgstr "%d gånger"

#, python-format
msgid "last: %s, %s"
msgstr "senast: %s, %s"

msgid "never"
msgstr "aldrig"

msgid "Out of memory"
msgstr "Slut på minne"

msgid ""
"How often RAM and swap were full and the kernel had to end a program "
"(counted since the plugin was installed). If it happens, a swap file - or a "
"bigger one - helps."
msgstr ""
"Hur ofta RAM och växlingsutrymme var fulla och kärnan fick avsluta ett "
"program (sedan pluginet installerades). Händer det hjälper en växlingsfil – "
"eller en större."

msgid "Swap support"
msgstr "Swap-stöd"

msgid "yes"
msgstr "ja"

msgid "no"
msgstr "nej"

msgid "Required for swap files, swap partitions and zram."
msgstr "Krävs för växlingsfiler, växlingspartitioner och zram."

msgid ""
"zram compresses swapped out memory inside the RAM (about 2-3:1) - no drive "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"zram komprimerar utväxlat minne direkt i RAM (ungefär 2-3:1) - ingen enhet "
"behövs."

msgid "zram (compressed RAM)"
msgstr "zram (komprimerat RAM)"

msgid "zram algorithms"
msgstr "zram-algoritmer"

msgid "known after loading"
msgstr "kända efter laddning"

msgid ""
"Compression algorithms offered by the kernel. lz4 is fastest, zstd "
"compresses best."
msgstr ""
"Komprimeringsalgoritmer som kärnan erbjuder. lz4 är snabbast, zstd "
"komprimerar bäst."

#, python-format
msgid "active (%s)"
msgstr "aktiv (%s)"

msgid "available, inactive"
msgstr "tillgängligt, inaktivt"

msgid "zswap"
msgstr "zswap"

msgid ""
"zswap is a compressed cache in front of a swap file. It is only shown here "
"for information."
msgstr ""
"zswap är en komprimerad cache framför en växlingsfil. Den visas här endast "
"som information."

msgid "none (only internal flash)"
msgstr "inga (bara internt flashminne)"

msgid "none"
msgstr "inga"

msgid "Drives for swap files"
msgstr "Enheter för växlingsfiler"

msgid ""
"Drives with a Linux file system (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) that can hold a swap "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Enheter med ett Linux-filsystem (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) som kan rymma en "
"växlingsfil."

msgid "Kernel configuration"
msgstr "Kärnkonfiguration"

msgid ""
"/proc/config.gz lets the plugin see exactly which features the kernel was "
"built with."
msgstr ""
"Med /proc/config.gz ser tillägget exakt vilka funktioner kärnan byggdes med."

msgid "Swappiness"
msgstr "Swappiness"

msgid "Page size"
msgstr "Sidstorlek"

#, python-format
msgid "%d bytes"
msgstr "%d byte"

msgid "Simple Swap Manager settings"
msgstr "Inställningar för Simple Swap Manager"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Spara"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Av"

msgid "Swap file at startup"
msgstr "Växlingsfil vid start"

msgid ""
"This swap file is activated automatically every time the receiver starts. "
"The plugin waits up to three minutes for the storage device to be mounted."
msgstr ""
"Den här växlingsfilen aktiveras automatiskt varje gång mottagaren startar. "
"Tillägget väntar upp till tre minuter på att enheten monteras."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"How eagerly the kernel moves memory to swap (0-100). Lower values keep data "
"in RAM longer; 10-30 is a good choice for receivers. Current value: %d"
msgstr ""
"Hur gärna kärnan flyttar minne till swap (0-100). Lägre värden håller data "
"längre i RAM; 10-30 är ett bra val för mottagare. Aktuellt värde: %d"

msgid ""
"Lower values also mean fewer writes, which spares SD cards and USB sticks."
msgstr ""
"Låga värden innebär också färre skrivningar, vilket skonar SD-kort och USB-"
"minnen."

#, python-format
msgid "Automatic (%s)"
msgstr "Automatisk (%s)"

msgid "zram compression"
msgstr "zram-komprimering"

msgid ""
"Compression algorithm for the compressed RAM swap. lz4 is fastest, zstd "
"compresses best but needs more CPU. A change takes effect the next time zram"
" is set up."
msgstr ""
"Komprimeringsalgoritm för den komprimerade RAM-swappen. lz4 är snabbast, "
"zstd komprimerar bäst men kräver mer CPU. Ändringen gäller nästa gång zram "
"sätts upp."

msgid "zram at startup"
msgstr "zram vid start"

#, python-format
msgid "Set up the compressed RAM swap (%s) every time the receiver starts."
msgstr ""
"Sätt upp den komprimerade RAM-swappen (%s) varje gång mottagaren startar."

msgid "On"
msgstr "På"

msgid "Show plugin in"
msgstr "Visa tillägget i"

msgid ""
"Where Simple Swap Manager can be opened. A change takes effect after "
"restarting the GUI."
msgstr ""
"Var Simple Swap Manager kan öppnas. Ändringen gäller efter omstart av GUI."

msgid ""
"Shows what this receiver supports: kernel, zram, zswap and drives. Press OK "
"to open."
msgstr ""
"Visar vad den här mottagaren stöder: kärna, zram, zswap och enheter. Tryck "
"OK för att öppna."

msgid "Open"
msgstr "Öppna"

msgid "Uninstall plugin..."
msgstr "Avinstallera tillägget..."

msgid ""
"Removes Simple Swap Manager from this receiver. You can choose whether the "
"swap space is kept or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort Simple Swap Manager från den här mottagaren. Du kan välja om "
"växlingsutrymmet ska behållas eller raderas."

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Avinstallera"

msgid "Uninstall Simple Swap Manager"
msgstr "Avinstallera Simple Swap Manager"

