msgstr "Ingen lämplig lagring"

msgid ""
"No storage device with a Linux file system (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) was found.\n"
"Swap files cannot be created on FAT, exFAT, NTFS or network drives."
msgstr ""
"Ingen lagringsenhet med ett Linux-filsystem (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) hittades.\n"
"Växlingsfiler kan inte skapas på FAT, exFAT, NTFS eller nätverksenheter."

msgid "No drive needed  ·  fastest  ·  uses a little CPU"
msgstr "Ingen enhet behövs  ·  snabbast  ·  använder lite CPU"

