msgstr "Swappiness satt till %d"

msgid "Protect the SD card?"
msgstr "Skona SD-kortet?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The swappiness is %d. With 10, the receiver swaps out less often and writes "
"less to the card."
msgstr ""
"Swappiness är %d. Med 10 växlar mottagaren mer sällan och skriver mindre "
"till kortet."

msgid "Set swappiness to 10"
msgstr "Sätt swappiness till 10"

#, python-format
msgid "Keep %d"
msgstr "Behåll %d"

